# WordPress.org Theme Directory & Theme Review

This theme is intended for the [WordPress Theme Directory](https://wordpress.org/themes/).
Directory inclusion requires meeting [Theme Review](https://make.wordpress.org/themes/handbook/review/) requirements.

## What this means

- The zip must be a **complete block theme** with Stackable inactive: blog, pages, header/footer, and color variations work.
- No plugin territory in the theme: custom blocks, shortcodes, CPTs, contact forms, analytics, starter-site/demo importers.
- No `stackable/*` markup in `templates/`, `parts/`, or `patterns/`.
- PHP bootstrap file is `functions.php` (not `function.php`). Prefix theme functions with `start_stackable_`.
- Front-end copyright/branding is the **user's** site, not the theme author brand.
- Prefer WordPress coding, escaping, i18n (`start-stackable` text domain), and enqueue practices Theme Review enforces.
- When changing PHP, templates, `theme.json`, or packaging, keep Theme Review green in mind. Fix regressions rather than silencing them without cause.

